 3. Training data 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Anthropic will not release a slightly stronger model it is testing internally. (Axios) The release of GLM-5.3 on Friday highlights how Chinese open-weight models are closing in on U.S. frontier models' ability to find and exploit security flaws. (Axios) 
 
